Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:58.99,屏字,,0,0,0,,{\c&H595758&\fs55\pos(942,668)}赛罗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.78,0:22:04.07,屏字,,0,0,0,,{\c&H595758&\fs55\pos(997,674)}连同我的份...
